        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Massimo Giordano, Anna Netrebko, Marcello Giordani\n- Places: Pompei, Italy, Metropolitan City of Naples\n- Roles: operatic tenor\n- Concepts: bel canto repertoire\nFacts:\n- Massimo Giordano was born on 19 February 1971.\n- Massimo Giordano was born in Pompei, Italy, into an Italian working-class family.\n- Pompei is a city and comune in the Metropolitan City of Naples in Italy.\n- Pompei is home to ancient Roman ruins that are part of a UNESCO World Heritage Site.\n- Massimo Giordano is an Italian-born operatic tenor known for his bel canto repertoire.\n- Massimo Giordano toured with Anna Netrebko in 2009.\n- Marcello Giordani is a different Italian tenor from Massimo Giordano.",
